TranslationUnitDecl
|-ClassTemplateDecl Box
| |-TemplateTypeParmDecl referenced class depth 0 index 0 T
| |-CXXRecordDecl struct Box definition
| | `-FieldDecl value 'T'
| |-ClassTemplateSpecializationDecl struct Box
| | `-TemplateArgument type 'int'
| `-ClassTemplateSpecializationDecl struct Box
|   `-TemplateArgument type 'char'
|-VarDecl p 'Box<int> *' cinit
| `-ImplicitCastExpr 'Box<int> *' <NullToPointer>
|   `-CXXNullPtrLiteralExpr 'std::nullptr_t'
`-VarDecl r 'Box<char> &' cinit
  `-UnaryOperator 'Box<char>' lvalue prefix '*' cannot overflow
    `-CStyleCastExpr 'Box<char> *' <NoOp>
      `-ImplicitCastExpr 'Box<char> *' <NullToPointer> part_of_explicit_cast
        `-CXXNullPtrLiteralExpr 'std::nullptr_t'
